T1643	Entity 149943 149950	Scrooge
T1644	Quotation 149952 150201	"I am in earnest. Go and buy it, and tell 'em to bring it here, that I may give them the direction where to take it. Come back with the man, and I'll give you a shilling. Come back with him in less than five minutes, and I'll give you half-a-crown!"
